{
  "access_mode": "standard",
  "alignment": {
    "acceptance": [
      "config defines 7 UI font-size steps (extra_small, small, medium, normal, large, very_large, huge) with default 'normal'.",
      "ui_state_service resolves each step to base_point_size * its factor (0.80/0.90/0.95/1.00/1.15/1.30/1.50); an unknown step resolves as 'normal' (factor 1.0).",
      "Applying UI settings sets the application font point size to base * ui_font_size_step factor.",
      "The theme stylesheet sizes text-editor windows (QTextEdit/QPlainTextEdit) at base * text_font_size_step factor, independent of the UI step, while control-role editors use the UI step size.",
      "build_default_settings() includes ui_font_size_step and text_font_size_step both equal to 'normal'.",
      "validate_settings repairs a missing/invalid font-size step to 'normal' and maps a legacy ui_text_scale value to the nearest new step."
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Same 7-step scale is offered for both UI and text fonts; default normal (x1.0).",
      "Theme font/text_font point_size is now driven by the global steps; brand themes already carry point_size None so nothing else fixes size."
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-07-25T07:21:53+00:00",
    "decision": "proceed",
    "open_questions": [],
    "planned_paths": [
      "04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/config.py",
      "04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/ui_state_service.py",
      "04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/settings_service.py"
    ],
    "reason": "Additive settings + a contained apply/size-injection change reusing existing font infrastructure; fully unit-testable, reversible, no workflow-domain data. User approved this plan and its decisions.",
    "recommended_responses": [],
    "risk": "low",
    "scope": [
      "IN: config font-size step constants; ui_state_service factor map + resolver + apply_theme/apply_ui_settings size injection; settings_service defaults+validation+migration; their unit tests. OUT: Settings page UI redesign (Slice 6); per-page scroll/anti-truncation (Slice 7); sidebar/min-resolution (Slice 8)."
    ],
    "source": "User chat: implement global font-size steps (7 steps), separate UI-controls vs text-window font, simplified Settings; keep controls visible. This slice = service/config/persistence model only (Slice 5).",
    "understanding": "Add two theme-independent settings ui_font_size_step and text_font_size_step, each one of 7 named steps (extra_small 0.80, small 0.90, medium 0.95, normal 1.00, large 1.15, very_large 1.30, huge 1.50; default normal). In apply_theme, compute ui_point = base*ui_factor and text_point = base*text_factor, inject them into the normalized theme font.point_size / text_font.point_size, set the app font to ui_point, and build the stylesheet so text editors use text_point while control-role editors use ui_point. apply_ui_settings reads both steps from settings and passes them. settings_service defaults both to normal, repairs invalid to normal, and migrates a legacy ui_text_scale value to the nearest step. Theme keeps colors + font family only. No Settings UI in this slice."
  },
